{"availability":"available","full":"claredolino-sys/cdmis-demo","name":"cdmis-demo","description":"A fully functional, zero-backend replica of an enterprise Document Management System. Showcases complex state management, role-based workflows, and automated audit trails using persistent local storage.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-29T10:35:34Z","updated":"2026-08-29T18:02:21Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cdmis-demo.netlify.app","topics":["demo","document-management-system","management-information-system","rbac","react","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://cdmis-demo.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:25.293Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:25.293Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:25.293Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:25.293Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Note: This is a sanitized, zero-backend demonstration of an enterprise application originally built for a university Records and Archives Office. All sensitive organizational data, logos, and identities have been anonymized for public portfolio showcasing.","A fully functional frontend replica of a Document Management System. This demo showcases complex state management, multi-tier role-based workflows, and automated audit trails without requiring a live backend, utilizing a custom localStorage database engine to persist session data."],"features":["Role-Based Access Control (RBAC): Distinct dashboards and permissions for System Admins, Department Records Custodians (DRC), and Staff.","Document Workflows: Upload, review, approve, and archive lifecycle management.","Request Pipeline: Staff can request access to restricted documents with approval routing to the respective Custodian.","Persistent Local Database: All interactions (new documents, users, requests) are instantly saved to the browser's localStorage, sim